> a(x: u8, y: u8) = x*y where x < y
> b(x: u8, y: u8) = y*x
> equiv a b
a and b are equal on the domain of a (exhaustive)
  domain: x in 0..254, y in 1..255 by the where clause (65025 points enumerated)
> c(x: u32, y: u32) = 0 where x == 0
> d(x: u32, y: u32) = x*y
